2fdbe0959518bba7d3baa10\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-31\",\n     \"title\": \"Markets Brief: Value ETFs Making a Big Tech Bet, Nvidia’s Dealmaking, and the Cybersecurity Stock Outlook\",\n     \"chars\": 9101\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:4f85affb9aaa7d877e4539c2\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-19\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia Skips New Gaming GPUs in 2026: RTX 60 Delay - https://tech-insider.org/\",\n     \"chars\": 21332\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:0fdddf6a7cdc3904b78a8653\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-28\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia in Talks to Backstop $250 Billion in OpenAI Data Center Financing\",\n     \"chars\": 6413\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:61332f6e93b88db0d3214cab\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-30\",\n     \"title\": \"Best AI Stocks After Nvidia Earnings: NVDA, AMD, Broadcom, Marvell or Arm?\",\n     \"chars\": 8051\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:1219126db2e6631aa1264142\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-16\",\n     \"title\": \"What Nvidia's $500 billion Wall Street deal signals about the AI boom\",\n     \"chars\": 4363\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:910a0652e8879b8859c8927d\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-22\",\n     \"title\": \"At NVIDIA, Kshitiz Khatri Is Learning the Business Behind AI\",\n     \"chars\": 4598\n    }\n   ]\n  }\n }\n}","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
